    <item>
      <title>Integrated CNC Grinding Solutions for Precision Manufacturing</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/products/gj-400/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/products/gj-400/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Advanced CNC Grinding for Multifaceted Precision Work 
    &lt;div id=&#34;advanced-cnc-grinding-for-multifaceted-precision-work&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#advanced-cnc-grinding-for-multifaceted-precision-work&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The GJ-400 CNC Hybrid ID &amp;amp; OD Cylindrical Grinding Machine is engineered to streamline complex grinding tasks by combining both internal and external cylindrical grinding capabilities in a single, efficient process. This hybrid approach enables users to perform ID and OD grinding in one clamping, significantly reducing equipment and labor costs while boosting productivity and versatility.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Precision and Versatility in CNC Cylindrical Grinding</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/products/go-356/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-ccm-comork/en/products/go-356/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Advanced CNC Cylindrical Grinding for Demanding Applications 
    &lt;div id=&#34;advanced-cnc-cylindrical-grinding-for-demanding-applications&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#advanced-cnc-cylindrical-grinding-for-demanding-applications&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The GO-356 CNC Cylindrical Grinding Machine is engineered for high-precision and versatile grinding tasks. Designed to automate complex processes, it ensures consistent, high-quality results across a wide range of workpieces, including shafts, gears, turbine components, surgical tools, molds, and more. With a distance between centers of 650mm, the GO-356 accommodates larger workpieces compared to the GO-354, making it suitable for demanding industrial requirements.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
